SB-Mac (Service Bus Explorer for macOS)
=======================================

This project is an independent macOS application inspired by, and functionally
modelled on, the Windows Service Bus Explorer:

    https://github.com/paolosalvatori/ServiceBusExplorer
    Copyright (c) 2015 Microsoft Azure
    Licensed under the MIT License

SB-Mac does not contain source code from that project. The Windows application is
built on WinForms and the legacy WCF-based `WindowsAzure.ServiceBus` SDK, neither
of which runs on macOS, so both its UI and its service layer were reimplemented
here on cross-platform foundations:

    Avalonia                        MIT License
    Azure.Messaging.ServiceBus      MIT License
    Azure.Identity                  MIT License
    Azure.ResourceManager.ServiceBus  MIT License
    CommunityToolkit.Mvvm           MIT License

Naming, terminology and the overall shape of the tool follow the original so that
people already familiar with it can find their way around.
